WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
Move your microphone closer, keep the input

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.400
below clipping, record 10 seconds of room

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.520
tone, do not remove every breath, listen

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.720
for background noise, turn off the loud

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.420
ceiling fan, check your headphones before recording,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.840
save a copy of the original.